B.I2=new A.nX("EN","FAMILY CALENDAR","A FAMILY TALE","The old doctor's\nsecret","Long before this calendar existed, an old doctor spent his days in a small clinic, welcoming one newborn after another into the world.","One day, someone long forgotten shared with him a strange little method \u2014 a way of reading dates, said to whisper whether a boy or a girl was on its way.","There was no science in it. No textbook carried its name. But the old doctor, curious as doctors often are, began to note it down quietly \u2014 year after year, for forty years.","By the time he set down his stethoscope for the last time, his notes told a curious story of their own: more often than not, the old method had guessed right.","Nobody can explain why. Perhaps nobody should. This calendar simply carries his story forward \u2014 not as medicine, but as an old family game between dates and the names yet to come.","Begin the story","Every date tells\na little story.","Choose a path below \u2014 reveal today's colour, or explore years of possible days ahead.","I'm expecting","Enter a conception date you already know and reveal today's colour.","Reveal a day","Plan ahead","Browse a ten-year window and find your best days for either colour.","Explore the calendar","MOTHER","FATHER","CONCEPTION DATE","Select date","Reveal today's colour","Recalculate","Reveal the calendar","Conception date must be after both parents' birth dates.","Calendar","Periods","Jump to month and day","Select birth date","Select conception date","Cancel","Confirm","dd/mm/yyyy","Date (dd/mm/yyyy)","Boy-leaning","Girl-leaning","Neutral","Neutral means the two scores tie on that day, so the calculation can't lean toward either colour.","Show days that lean","Girl","Boy","Pick the Girl or Boy card above to see the conception periods for that gender.","No conception periods of this type were found in the 10-year range.","Calendar window \xb7 from today, 10 years forward","Periods window \xb7 from today, 10 years forward","TODAY'S COLOUR","Leaning blue today","Leaning blush today","It's a neutral day","On this date, the odds tip gently toward a little boy.","On this date, the odds tip gently toward a little girl.","This date keeps its secret \u2014 the signs are evenly balanced, so either colour could arrive.","For fun only \u2014 not a medical or scientific method.","Preparing\u2026",'That day hasn\'t happened yet \u2014 tap here to switch to "Plan ahead" and explore future days.','That day is in the past \u2014 if you already know the conception date, tap here to switch to "I\'m expecting".',B.uh,B.ad,A.aVv())
